WEBVTT

s1-league-season
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:17.320
Riley, the organizer at Lakeside Golf Collective, creates a league, then a season inside it with start and end dates. There are no divisions yet — FliHub simply runs the season division-less until the organizer needs them.

s2-direct-entry
00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:30.530
Teams don't wait for divisions. Riley enters the Blue Heron Flyers directly into the season, and the entry shows exactly that: no division assigned.

s3-division-assign
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:43.510
When the structure firms up, Riley creates an Open division and assigns the existing entry to it. The same entry now carries the Open badge in place of "no division assigned".

s4-events
00:00:48.230 --> 00:01:02.020
Events work both ways. The Harvest Open stands alone, marked Independent, while Week 1 is linked to the season and wears its season badge — so an organizer can tell them apart at a glance.
